details:
Following a Memorial Service at Christ Church, Bundaberg for His Royal Highness, The Prince Philip, Duke of Edinburgh, the tenor was rung half-muffled on the day of his funeral.
Rest eternal grant unto him, O Lord;
and let light perpetual shine upon him.

72: Norfolk, Berwick, Hexham, Hull, Bourne, York, Durham;
144: Cambridge, Primrose, Beverley, Surfleet
216: Ipswich
